Eddie the Eagle is a comedy, drama, history film directed by Dexter Fletcher.

3
00:16:44,210 --> 00:16:50,210
The feel-good story of Michael 'Eddie' Edwards, an unlikely but courageous British ski-jumper who
never stopped believing in himself—even as an entire nation was counting him out.

4
00:22:18,947 --> 00:22:24,947
With the help of a rebellious and charismatic coach, Eddie takes on the establishment and wins the hearts of sports
fans around the world by making an improbable and historic showing at the 1988 Calgary Winter Olympics.

